  "readme": [
    {
      "section": "xby-generate-prd-prompt",
      "text": "DeepSeek Harness (DSH) 的插件：动态提示生成服务\n\nMercury Spec Ops MCP Server 是一个基于模块化架构的动态提示生成和模板组装工具，适用于AI助手与专业内容的交互，支持31种技术栈、10种分析维度和34个模板部分的动态生成。"
    },
    {
      "section": "功能",
      "text": "- **set_xby_apikey** — 在聊天中设置 API 密钥（自动持久化，重启有效）\n- **generate_prd_prompt** — Generate an assembled Product Requirements Document prompt with specified technology stacks and analysis focus areas\n- **generate_codebase_analysis_prompt** — Generate an assembled codebase analysis prompt with specified technology stacks and analysis focus areas\n- **generate_bug_analysis_prompt** — Generate an assembled bug analysis prompt with specified technology stacks and severity level\n- **get_prd_template** — Fetch a comprehensive Product Requirements Document markdown template with all standard sections (14 sections total)\n- **get_codebase_analysis_template** — Fetch a comprehensive codebase analysis markdown template with all standard sections (12 sections total)\n- **get_bug_analysis_template** — Fetch a comprehensive bug analysis markdown template with all standard sections (8 sections total)"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式一：从 GitHub 直接安装（推荐）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "格式: dsh plugin --profile <profile> add github:<owner>/<repo>",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add github:xby_skill/xby-generate-prd-prompt\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式二：从本地目录安装（开发模式）",
      "text": "```bash"
    },
    {
      "section": "仅用于本地开发调试",
      "text": "dsh plugin --profile web add /absolute/path/to/xby-generate-prd-prompt\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "方式三：通过 cordis.patch.yml 开发调试",
      "text": "```bash\ndsh web --profile web --patch /absolute/path/to/dsh-ocr-plugin/cordis.patch.yml\n```"
    },
    {
      "section": "获取 API 密钥",
      "text": "前往 [小笨羊官网](https://xiaobenyang.com) 注册并获取 API 密钥。"
    }
  ],
